---

Portions of this firmware are derived from giovi321/smalltv-mod
(https://github.com/giovi321/smalltv-mod), released under the WTFPL. The display
core, WiFi/AP handling, settings persistence, the boot-time OTA path, and the
usage meter began as that project's code. Thanks are owed.

The pixel mascot animation frames originate from ClaudePix
(https://claudepix.vercel.app). Their licence is being confirmed; see
docs/mascot-licence.md before shipping hardware that uses them.
